      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a decent start, but to be honest, it feels a bit light. The board is going to want to see much more granular detail to feel confident that we actually looked at everything. \n\nCan you expand this? I need you to really dig into each of those areas. Break down the findings even further so the summary feels much more \"complete.\" I'm looking for much more depth—ideally a much higher density of points so nothing feels glossed over. Just like I said before, please keep it professional and meaningful, don't just repeat yourself, but definitely lean into that structure to make it look like a heavy-duty audit review.",
      "source": "evaluator"
